{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113484","id":3065799462,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62vGMm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113484","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113484.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113484.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113484","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113484/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113484/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113484/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3852728a92c32584f67fd4582e761579efdfc5a6","number":113484,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix replace parent node and paste child nodes then move cause crash","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113453*\r\n\r\n## Issue Descripion\r\n\r\nAs described in #113453, if we first change parent node type, then paste child nodes, then move nodes in editor. We will attempt to move the invalid nodes from before the changes.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\n~~We can set `pending_click_select = nullptr` in `paste_nodes()` to prevent using invalid node.~~\r\n\r\nEdited: We should clean `tree_clicked = false` after `replace_node()`, then later mouse click event won't select node by mistake.\r\n\r\n[replace-paste-move-crash.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1391865e-d259-4bc8-9cb3-1969243c5aa7)\r\n\r\n## Explaination\r\n\r\nWhen we execute \"change type\", we click mouse right key to display context menu, which will trigger `input()` to mark `tree_clicked = true` and save `pending_click_select = current_node`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9f5309a2a498ae2adfe2e7ac48d9813fd8ecc490/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L148-L152\r\n\r\nBut after executing `replace_node()`, `tree_clicked` is still `true`. That makes when triggered `_handle_select`, the `pending_click_select` always updated.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9f5309a2a498ae2adfe2e7ac48d9813fd8ecc490/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L1871-L1877\r\n\r\nWhenever we click mouse to trigger next `input()`, the `pending_click_select` will update to `editor_selection` with `push_item`. That makes the current selection changed and causes crash.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9f5309a2a498ae2adfe2e7ac48d9813fd8ecc490/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L154-L157\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-03T03:42:34Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T21:39:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d846a071f5ff627224167d5b0782754586c78b12","assignee":nu